.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH voa-config 1  "voa-config " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
voa\-config \- Interact with the VOA configuration for technology backends.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvoa config\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Interact with the VOA configuration for technology backends.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
voa\-config\-list(1)
List the origins of technology settings used by OSes and specific contexts.
.TP
voa\-config\-show(1)
Show OS or context\-level technology settings.
.TP
voa\-config\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
